[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708784885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103795#issuecomment-2708784885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103795","id":2708784885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hdMb1","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T10:25:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T10:25:45Z","body":"I can't reproduce this.\n\n> * Pressing space shows that `_input()` is reading a different value for `foo` than the decorated `bar()` is\n\nNotice that in `_input()` you call `bar()` which increments `foo`.\n\n> * Stop running the project\n> * Run the project again\n> * Press the inspector button again to show that the changes made in the last run of the project are still there\n\nThis can't happen because you didn't export `foo` using `@export`, `@export_storage`, etc. After each restart the value will be reset to 1 in this case.\n\nHere is the corrected version. `_input()` does not work in the editor for me, and also your script inherits from `Object` although it should from `Node`.\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node\n\n@export_tool_button(\"Button\") var action = bar\nvar foo = 1\n\nfunc bar() -> void:\n    foo += 1\n    prints(\"bar():\", foo)\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n    if Input.is_key_pressed(KEY_SPACE):\n        prints(\"_process():\", foo)\n```\n\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708784885/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2709201132","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103795#issuecomment-2709201132","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103795","id":2709201132,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6heyDs","user":{"login":"eris-of-mars","id":152103445,"node_id":"U_kgDOCRDqFQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152103445?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars","html_url":"https://github.com/eris-of-mars","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T01:11:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T04:03:51Z","body":"Ah sorry, I'm pretty new to godot, the issue is still there for me when attached to a Control and Node2D as well. I tested the script while on a Control but extending Object since that was the highest-level parent object I could find. I'm not sure why you can't reproduce though? I know both the spacebar and the editor button will increment foo so I typically press the editor button a few times so foo goes up to like 5 and then press the spacebar and it prints 2, the spacebar thus obviously incremented the value but the difference is still visible. The reason I had the spacebar increase foo was to show that an increase from either source doesn't reach the other (just in case changing a variable outside a decorated function also changed it inside the decorated function but not vice versa).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2709201132/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711166370","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103795#issuecomment-2711166370","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103795","id":2711166370,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hmR2i","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T16:29:31Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T16:34:56Z","body":"This is because there is 2 versions. Because it is a tool script, it runs in the editor, and because it is on a node in the scene it runs in the game as well. Pressing space is in the game and increments the game one, while pressing the tool button increments the editor one. You can click the button when the game isn't running to see just the editor one working by itself. This looks like expected behavior to me.\n\nEdit: Also when I switch to the remote scene tree and inspect the remote node, the tool button is also there but it doesn't work with an error (`ERROR: The value of property \"action\" is Nil, but Callable was expected.`) I'm not sure why.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711166370/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711919033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103795#issuecomment-2711919033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103795","id":2711919033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hpJm5","user":{"login":"eris-of-mars","id":152103445,"node_id":"U_kgDOCRDqFQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152103445?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars","html_url":"https://github.com/eris-of-mars","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eris-of-mars/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T21:45:26Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T21:45:26Z","body":"That error's been reported a few times, you just need to restart godot and the inspector button will start working. Thanks for the explanation though! So does that mean this is all the expected behavior? If @export_tool_button is intended to be used outside of the scene tree the different variable versions would make sense but the persistence still feels possibly unintentional.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711919033/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2718838742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103795#issuecomment-2718838742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103795","id":2718838742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iDi_W","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-12T19:00:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-12T19:00:59Z","body":"The persistence is expected, it will last until the editor is closed since it operates in the editor.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2718838742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]